,[22018,19.7,2022,38,110,24],[22019,20.3,2022,39,111,22],[22020,20.9,2022,44,113,23]],"links":[["Finney County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/kansas/finney-county"],["ARC or PLC in Finney County","/arc-plc/kansas/finney-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids came in under 90% of normal in January to February in 41 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2026 so far, February to March sat at 7% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2025, August to September ran 175% of normal on the middle. Grid 21117 had its driest year in 1956 at 33% of normal.</p>"}
